  m_text: '<color=#F0A020><b>Watch it live</b></color>   See EOSAT-1 orbit the Earth in real time, with its attitude, the Sun and eclipses.

    <color=#F0A020><b>Stay in the hub</b></color>   A globe, data panels and a ground-track map float around you. Move and resize them as you like.

    <color=#F0A020><b>Fly out to it</b></color>   Switch to space view for a close look at the satellite from six viewpoints.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
